    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Turns parked on subagent yield (24h)",
      "description": "NOT a failure signal \u2014 do not alert on this. Measures dispatches that completed with reason=none and started no delivery. Verified 2026-08-30 (home-infra #100): on the first real capture this was 4/4 SUBAGENT YIELDS, not silent failures. The agent delegates, parks the turn via sessions_yield (which aborts the in-flight model request in ~20-46ms, surfacing as a [model-fetch] error), and the SUBAGENT delivers later \u2014 all four were followed by a successful send 28-376s afterwards. A non-zero value here is normal on a bot that uses subagents. reason=active_run_injected is excluded: those fold into an already-running turn and correctly produce no reply of their own. Caveat: one reply emitting both text and media counts twice in delivery_started, biasing this LOW. A real silent-failure detector must correlate the parked turn against a LATER delivery on the same session with a deadline \u2014 this panel cannot distinguish yield-with-delivery from yield-with-nothing. See home-infra #100.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 9,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "clamp_min(sum(increase(openclaw_message_dispatch_completed_total{reason=\"none\"}[24h])) - sum(increase(openclaw_message_delivery_started_total[24h])), 0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
